desired>m, TEXT TO BE AFFECTED BY CODE, control-left bracket, left
bracket, 0m)

The numbers to be placed in front of the first m are as follows:

1 = bold
2 = dim
3 = normal
4 = underlined normal
5 = blinking normal
6 = normal
7 = inverse video
8 = invisible
9 = normal

"0m" code turns text back to normal.

